					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10034685#post-4126264</guid>
				<title>Re: Author Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10034685/ambrose-restaurants-hub#post-4126264</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 21 Jan 2019 16:37:02 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Uncle Nicolini</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3487700</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I have a knack for making hubs and I love GoIs, so I figured I may as well lend Pro a hand at making their GoI's hub. :P Pro is a cool person and I sincerely appreciate them and Ambrose, as I spent a good chunk of my life in food service and this GoI speaks to me a little.</p> <p>A lot of this css was repurposed from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1548088622" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" >stormbreath</a></span>'s fantastic <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/ambrose-london-prix-fixe">Ambrose London Prix Fixe</a>, which I suggest you check out if you're at all interested in the group.</p> <p>Hope you all enjoy, and seriously, tip your waiters.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
