					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10034685#post-4126254</guid>
				<title>Author Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10034685/ambrose-restaurants-hub#post-4126254</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 21 Jan 2019 16:33:07 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Proasek</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2048131</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Well that was unexpected.</span></p> <p>The Ambrose Restaurant is a GoI, so of course it needs a hub. Massive thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1548088446" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span> for setting this up, as well as <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1548088446" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" >stormbreath</a></span> for creating some of the CSS used on it. Thanks to everyone on #Site19 for helping to make this hub happen (primarily by listening to me winge about not being able to write my thoughts for the guide) and most of all thanks to all the stunning authors who contributed a work and turned this from a one off idea in the maddest part of my brain into all of this. I definitely couldn't have done it without all of you.</p> <p>So go forth, read and write and most of all enjoy the Ambrose Restaurant!</p> <p>Tip your waiters.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
